From 2dd09405644471652fa15ff93c2c27c384cf6135 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil Elwell <phil@raspberrypi.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 09:31:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] overlays: Replace pinctrl nodes with GPIO_PULLs

There are cases where a pinctrl node has been used to declare an input,
the only reason for which is to enable or change the pull bias on the
pin. This can be simplified using GPIO_PULL_UP, GPIO_PULL_DOWN or
GPIO_PULL_DISABLE in the flags field.

Signed-off-by: Phil Elwell <phil@raspberrypi.com>
---
